Package: linuxscp
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: secure file transfer client for the command line
 LinuxSCP is the console file transfer client of the LinuxSCP project. It
 connects to an SFTP server over SSH and transfers files to and from the
 local file system, either from a script, from a command line, or
 interactively.
 .
 The SSH and SFTP protocol code is the PuTTY core, driven by a native POSIX
 front end.
